{
    "title": "Parachute Plasma Donation",
    "description": "Parachute is the quickest and easiest way to earn money donating plasma. As a Parachute Member, you can enjoy the flexibility of choosing when and how often you\u2019d like to come in. No investment. No commitments.\r\n\r\nWhy Parachute?\r\n\r\n* Instant Payment: your payment gets automatically processed to your Parachute card every time you donate. The card has ATM access and can be used as a debit card.\r\n\r\n* Earn When You Feel Like It: a meaningful alternative to seasonal work, temp work, gig work, or a part-time job.\r\n\r\n* Simple Pay Model: you'll always know how much you'll earn even before stepping foot into one of our centers.\r\n\r\n* Refer a Friend, Get $70: Earn up to $70 for each referral. There's no limit on how many people you can refer.\r\n\r\n* More Ways To Earn: In-app bonuses to help you boost your earnings and level up.\r\n\r\n* Quick and Convenient: our goal is to get you in, out, and on with your day in about an hour.\r\n\r\n* Earn With Purpose: it feels good to help others. Your donation will help provide life-saving medicine for people who need it.\r\n\r\nRequirements\r\n\u2022 Donors must be 18-64 years old.\r\n\r\nThe Join Parachute, LLC Visa\u00ae Prepaid Card is issued by Pathward\u00ae, N.A., Member FDIC, pursuant to a license from Visa\u00ae U.S.A. Inc. Card can be used everywhere Visa\u00ae prepaid cards are accepted. Visa\u00ae is a registered trademark of Visa\u00ae U.S.A. Inc. All other trademarks and service marks belong to their respective owners. Standard text message and data rates, fees, and charges may apply.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Parachute is the quickest and easiest way to earn money donating plasma. As a Parachute Member, you can enjoy the flexibility of choosing when and how often you\u2019d like to come in. No investment. No commitments.<br><br>Why Parachute?<br><br>* Instant Payment: your payment gets automatically processed to your Parachute card every time you donate. The card has ATM access and can be used as a debit card.<br><br>* Earn When You Feel Like It: a meaningful alternative to seasonal work, temp work, gig work, or a part-time job.<br><br>* Simple Pay Model: you&#39;ll always know how much you&#39;ll earn even before stepping foot into one of our centers.<br><br>* Refer a Friend, Get $70: Earn up to $70 for each referral. There&#39;s no limit on how many people you can refer.<br><br>* More Ways To Earn: In-app bonuses to help you boost your earnings and level up.<br><br>* Quick and Convenient: our goal is to get you in, out, and on with your day in about an hour.<br><br>* Earn With Purpose: it feels good to help others. Your donation will help provide life-saving medicine for people who need it.<br><br>Requirements<br>\u2022 Donors must be 18-64 years old.<br><br>The Join Parachute, LLC Visa\u00ae Prepaid Card is issued by Pathward\u00ae, N.A., Member FDIC, pursuant to a license from Visa\u00ae U.S.A. Inc. Card can be used everywhere Visa\u00ae prepaid cards are accepted. Visa\u00ae is a registered trademark of Visa\u00ae U.S.A. Inc. All other trademarks and service marks belong to their respective owners. Standard text message and data rates, fees, and charges may apply.",
